---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Labs" description="Research labs: Space Instrumentation and Space Weather at the HelioUSACH group.">

<section>
  <span class="section-title">Labs</span>
  <h1>Our laboratories</h1>
  <p class="lead">Two research labs dedicated to observation, instrumentation, and prediction in heliophysics and space weather.</p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">
    <h3>Space Instrumentation Lab</h3>
    <p>Ground-based magnetometer networks, field campaigns, and real-time geomagnetic data acquisition.</p>
    <ul style="margin:0.75rem 0 0 1.5rem">
      <li>SAMBA magnetometer network (meridional chain from Arica to Magallanes, Chile)</li>
      <li>Magnetometer deployment and calibration in field campaigns</li>
      <li>Antarctic base campaigns (Chilean Scientific Antarctic Expedition 47, 2011)</li>
      <li>Comparative magnetometer performance analysis (Universidad Adventista de Chile, 2025)</li>
      <li>Real-time data acquisition and processing</li>
      <li>Collaboration with MACCS, THEMIS GBO, and CARISMA networks</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">
    <h3>Space Weather Lab</h3>
    <p>Real-time space weather monitoring, machine learning-based prediction, and satellite data analysis.</p>
    <ul style="margin:0.75rem 0 0 1.5rem">
      <li>National Space Weather Platform (FONDEF IDEA I+D 2025)</li>
      <li>Real-time solar wind data monitoring (OMNI)</li>
      <li>Deep learning models (RNN, CNN, LSTM) for magnetic perturbations and GIC prediction</li>
      <li>Relativistic electron flux prediction in the radiation belts</li>
      <li>Plasmapause location with machine learning</li>
      <li>Satellite data processing: Van Allen Probes, THEMIS, GOES, MMS</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <span class="section-title">Data sources</span>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Satellites</h3>
      <p>Van Allen Probes (MagEIS, REPT, EMFISIS, EFW) · THEMIS (SPEDAS) · GOES · MMS · OMNI</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Ground magnetometers</h3>
      <p>SAMBA · MACCS · THEMIS GBO · CARISMA · SuperDARN</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Tools</h3>
      <p>Python (SciPy, Pandas, Numpy, Matplotlib, SpacePy) · TensorFlow-Keras · PyTorch · Scikit-learn</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>